    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Positive</td><td>Finger burning in the cold, much less; no dizziness</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No nausea now; normal appetite</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood better; PHQ-9 3</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>3 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

